{% comment %}
  Hero slideshow — 首页首屏（task-index T-2.1，pages-ui §2）。

  实现：CSS scroll-snap 横滑（原生滚动，触摸/键盘可达）。文字内容放在
  左下角一张**固定的半透明卡片**里（图片随 track 滚动，卡片不滚）：
  卡片内含标题/副标题/CTA（多张各自渲染成 caption，切换时淡入淡出过渡）
  + 底部「圆点 + 上一张/下一张」箭头。图片切换循环：到最后一张再点
  下一张回到第一张（反向同理）。
  LCP 硬约束（SDD §8.1）：第一张幻灯图 eager + fetchpriority high，其余 lazy。
  首块标题为 h1（每页一个 h1，AGENTS.md §8）；其余块 h2。
{% endcomment %}

{%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
  <div
    class="hero-slideshow full-width"
    role="region"
    aria-roledescription="carousel"
    aria-label="{{ 'sections.hero_slideshow.aria_label' | t }}"
  >
    <div class="hero-slideshow__track" tabindex="0">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign is_first = forloop.first
          assign loading = 'lazy'
          assign fetch_priority = 'auto'
          if is_first
            assign loading = 'eager'
            assign fetch_priority = 'high'
          endif
        -%}
        <div class="hero-slideshow__slide" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <div class="hero-slideshow__media{% if is_first == false %} hero-slideshow__media--lazy{% endif %}">
            {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
              {%- if block.settings.image_mobile != blank -%}
                <picture>
                  <source
                    media="(max-width: 749px)"
                    srcset="{{ block.settings.image_mobile | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w, {{ block.settings.image_mobile | image_url: width: 1400 }} 1400w"
                    sizes="100vw"
                    width="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.width }}"
                    height="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.height }}"
                  >
                  {{
                    block.settings.image
                    | image_url: width: 2400
                    | image_tag:
                      widths: '800, 1200, 1600, 2400',
                      sizes: '100vw',
                      width: block.settings.image.width,
                      height: block.settings.image.height,
                      loading: loading,
                      fetchpriority: fetch_priority,
                      alt: block.settings.image.alt
                  }}
                </picture>
              {%- else -%}
                {{
                  block.settings.image
                  | image_url: width: 2400
                  | image_tag:
                    widths: '800, 1200, 1600, 2400',
                    sizes: '100vw',
                    width: block.settings.image.width,
                    height: block.settings.image.height,
                    loading: loading,
                    fetchpriority: fetch_priority,
                    alt: block.settings.image.alt
                }}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- elsif is_first -%}
              {{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'hero-slideshow__placeholder' }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      固定半透明卡片：文字 caption（每张一份）+ 底部切换控件。
      文字不再随图滚动——caption 多份并存，第一张可见，JS 淡入淡出切换。
      卡片固定于左下，图片在背后滚动，是标准 hero 轮播形态（参考效果图）。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="hero-slideshow__card">
      <div class="hero-slideshow__captions">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign is_first = forloop.first
          -%}
          <div
            class="hero-slideshow__caption{% if is_first %} is-active{% endif %}"
            {% unless is_first %}aria-hidden="true"{% endunless %}
            data-hero-caption="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
          >
            {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
              {%- if is_first -%}
                <h1 class="hero-slideshow__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h1>
              {%- else -%}
                <h2 class="hero-slideshow__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if block.settings.subheading != blank -%}
              <p class="hero-slideshow__subheading">{{ block.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if block.settings.button_label != blank and block.settings.button_link != blank -%}
              <a class="hero-slideshow__cta" href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}">
                {{ block.settings.button_label | escape }}
              </a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          底部控件（仅多张时）：圆点（左）+ 上一张/下一张箭头（右），同一行、共享一份。
          放在卡片底部，位置固定，不随标题文字高度变化而跳动。
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if section.blocks.size > 1 -%}
          <div class="hero-slideshow__indicators">
            <div class="hero-slideshow__dots">
              {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="hero-slideshow__dot{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}"
                  aria-label="{{ 'sections.hero_slideshow.go_to_slide' | t: index: forloop.index }}"
                  {% unless forloop.first %}tabindex="-1"{% endunless %}
                  data-hero-dot="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
                ></button>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
            <div class="hero-slideshow__arrows">
              <button
                type="button"
                class="hero-slideshow__arrow"
                aria-label="{{ 'sections.hero_slideshow.previous' | t }}"
                data-hero-prev
              >
                {{ 'icon-chevron-down.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="hero-slideshow__arrow hero-slideshow__arrow--next"
                aria-label="{{ 'sections.hero_slideshow.next' | t }}"
                data-hero-next
              >
                {{ 'icon-chevron-down.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .hero-slideshow {
    position: relative;
  }
  .hero-slideshow__track {
    display: flex;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }
  .hero-slideshow__track::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }
    .hero-slideshow__slide {
      position: relative;
      flex: 0 0 100%;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
      min-height: clamp(22rem, 56vw, 44rem);
    }
    .hero-slideshow__media,
    .hero-slideshow__media img {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }
    .hero-slideshow__media img {
      object-fit: cover;
    }

  /* ---- 固定半透明卡片（左下角，文字 + 切换控件同卡） ---- */
  .hero-slideshow__card {
    position: absolute;
    inset-inline-start: 0;
    inset-block-end: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    /* 与内容列同款三列网格：卡片落在内容列（column 2），宽屏不漂边 */
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: var(--content-grid);
    width: 100%;
    padding-block-end: var(--page-margin);
    pointer-events: none; /* 卡片空白不挡图，文字链接/控件单独恢复 */
  }
  .hero-slideshow__card > * {
    grid-column: 2;
    pointer-events: auto;
  }
  .hero-slideshow__captions {
    position: relative;
    /* 半透明玻璃卡片（参考效果图）：背景从主题背景色派生 65% + 毛玻璃 + 圆角 +
       柔和阴影 + 白边高光。白底主题 = 白色卡片（参考效果），Noir = 深色卡片自动适配。 */
    width: min(26rem, 100%);
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-background) 65%, transparent);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgb(0 0 0 / 10%);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    overflow: hidden; /* 裁掉切换时移出卡片的 caption */
  }
  .hero-slideshow__caption {
    /* 多份 caption 叠加在卡片同一位置：激活的 relative 撑高卡片，
       其余 absolute 不占位。动画下沉到 subheading/heading 子元素，
       caption 层只做瞬时可见性切换（不做退出动画）。 */
  }
  .hero-slideshow__caption:not(.is-active) {
    position: absolute;
    inset-block-start: 1.25rem;
    inset-inline-start: 1.5rem;
    inset-inline-end: 1.5rem;
    visibility: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-slideshow__caption.is-active {
    position: relative;
  }

  /* 文字子元素的滑入动画：非激活项停在「屏外+透明」起始态，
     切到激活时滑入归位。方向由 root 的 data-direction 决定。 */
  .hero-slideshow__subheading,
  .hero-slideshow__heading {
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease;
  }
  /* 主标题比副标题晚 200ms（错峰滑入） */
  .hero-slideshow__heading {
    transition-delay: 0.2s;
  }
  .hero-slideshow__caption:not(.is-active) .hero-slideshow__subheading,
  .hero-slideshow__caption:not(.is-active) .hero-slideshow__heading {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(2.5rem); /* 默认（前进）方向：新文字从右滑入 */
  }
  /* 后退方向：新文字从左滑入 */
  .hero-slideshow[data-direction='prev']
    .hero-slideshow__caption:not(.is-active)
    .hero-slideshow__subheading,
  .hero-slideshow[data-direction='prev']
    .hero-slideshow__caption:not(.is-active)
    .hero-slideshow__heading {
    transform: translateX(-2.5rem);
  }
  .hero-slideshow__subheading {
    /* 副标题（标题下方）：灰绿弱化，从前景色派生 */
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 60%, transparent);
  }
  .hero-slideshow__heading {
    margin: 0;
    /* 深绿粗体标题（参考效果图），跟随品牌色 */
    color: var(--color-brand);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 700;
    max-width: 13rem;
  }
  .hero-slideshow__cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-block-start: 1rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
    min-height: 44px;
    background-color: var(--color-brand-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: var(--style-border-radius-inputs);
  }

  /* ---- 底部控件行内的圆形箭头（深绿底白箭头） ---- */
  .hero-slideshow__arrows {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .hero-slideshow__arrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-brand);
    color: #ffffff;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .hero-slideshow__arrow:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-brand-accent);
  }
  .hero-slideshow__arrow svg {
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 0.75rem;
  }
  .hero-slideshow__arrow--next svg {
    transform: rotate(-90deg);
  }
  .hero-slideshow__arrow:not(.hero-slideshow__arrow--next) svg {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }
  .hero-slideshow__arrow:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-brand-accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* ---- 卡片底部控件（在卡片背景内）：圆点（左）+ 箭头（右） ---- */
  .hero-slideshow__indicators {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    /* 与文字区分：顶部分隔线 + 上间距（已在卡片 padding 内） */
    margin-block-start: 1rem;
    padding-block-start: 0.75rem;
    border-block-start: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 12%, transparent);
  }
  .hero-slideshow__dots {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
  }
  .hero-slideshow__dot {
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    /* 未激活：弱化（从前景色派生淡档） */
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 35%, transparent);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .hero-slideshow__dot.is-active {
    background-color: var(--color-brand);
    transform: scale(1.25);
  }
  /* 移动端：隐藏底部控件（圆点+箭头，触摸横滑已覆盖），文字半透明卡片保留 */
  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .hero-slideshow__indicators {
      display: none;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

<script src="{{ 'hero-slideshow.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.hero_slideshow.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "hero-slideshow-section",
  "max_blocks": 5,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "name": "t:sections.hero_slideshow.blocks.slide.name",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "t:sections.hero_slideshow.blocks.slide.labels.image",
          "info": "t:sections.hero_slideshow.blocks.slide.labels.image_info"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image_mobile",
          "label": "t:sections.hero_slideshow.blocks.slide.labels.image_mobile",
          "info": "t:sections.hero_slideshow.blocks.slide.labels.image_mobile_info"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "t:labels.heading",
          "default": "t:sections.hero_slideshow.blocks.slide.defaults.heading"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "subheading",
          "label": "t:labels.subheading",
          "default": "t:sections.hero_slideshow.blocks.slide.defaults.subheading"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "button_label",
          "label": "t:labels.button_label",
          "default": "t:sections.hero_slideshow.blocks.slide.defaults.button_label"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "button_link",
          "label": "t:labels.button_link"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Coppice",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "t:sections.hero_slideshow.presets.slide_1.heading",
            "subheading": "t:sections.hero_slideshow.presets.slide_1.subheading",
            "button_label": "t:sections.hero_slideshow.presets.slide_1.button_label"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
